{
  "slug": "global-entry-appointment-scanner",
  "name": "Global Entry Appointment Scanner",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Find open Global Entry and NEXUS appointment slots and get notified. Includes a skill that helps you search for slots, set up continuous background monitoring, configure Discord/Slack/SMS/Email notifications, and hook up the MCP server to Claude Desktop",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `global-entry-scanner` (Help users find open Global Entry and NEXUS appointment slots, set up continuous monitoring, and configure notifications).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install global-entry-appointment-scanner@claude-community` from `JaiminBrahmbhatt/Global-Entry-Appointment-Scanner`.\n\nScan for open Global Entry / NEXUS appointment slots and get notified the moment one appears.",
